  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_01",
      "hash64": "EB85F4E3122FF757",
      "text": "嗨～阿罗拉！\\n我超喜欢阿罗拉的宝可梦哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_02",
      "hash64": "EB85F5E3122FF90A",
      "text": "我想看一眼\\n阿罗拉的样子的隆隆岩，\\r\\n你的同行宝可梦或盒子里有它吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_03",
      "hash64": "EB85F6E3122FFABD",
      "text": "只有隆隆岩\\n我无论如何都找不到……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_04",
      "hash64": "EB85EFE3122FEED8",
      "text": "这只宝可梦……\\n甚至都不是隆隆岩哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_05",
      "hash64": "EB85F0E3122FF08B",
      "text": "这只宝可梦……\\n只是普通的隆隆岩哦！！\\r\\n我想看的！是它阿罗拉的样子！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_06",
      "hash64": "EB85F1E3122FF23E",
      "text": "这只宝可梦……\\n是阿罗拉的样子的隆隆岩！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_07",
      "hash64": "EB85F2E3122FF3F1",
      "text": "头上绽开的样子充满异国情调！\\n眉毛和胡须也都威风凛凛～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_08",
      "hash64": "EB85EBE3122FE80C",
      "text": "……因为要通过连接交换来进化，\\n所以很少会遇到野生的吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_09",
      "hash64": "EB85ECE3122FE9BF",
      "text": "在感谢你的同时，请你来试试\\n这个既阿罗拉又隆隆岩的动作吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_system_01",
      "hash64": "340BF1E47E73D21E",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]从女孩那里\\n学会了[VAR 0xFF00(0008)]电Ｚ动作[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
